# outboard — the whole story in one take: the rack in, then each stage out and back, then no headroom.
# Deterministic and keyboard-only, so it survives a relayout (resolution-portable-input.md).
# The cart boots on the FULL preset already playing, so there is nothing to start.
# frames 900
# fps 30
# crf 28

# ── bars 1-2: the whole rack, as it boots ─────────────────────────────────────
# ── bar 3: park the PLATE out, because with it in every A/B below smears ~1s ──
down 130 4
up 131 4
# ── one stage out, then back: EQ, then IRON, then COMP ────────────────────────
down 220 1
up 221 1
down 310 1
up 311 1
down 400 2
up 401 2
down 490 2
up 491 2
down 580 3
up 581 3
down 670 3
up 671 3
# ── the punchline: take the headroom away and watch the rack stop mattering ───
down 760 H
up 761 H
# ── and give it back ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
down 860 H
up 861 H
